#: ../../src/fs_poll.rst:5
msgid ":c:type:`uv_fs_poll_t` --- FS Poll handle"
msgstr ":c:type:`uv_fs_poll_t` —— FS Poll 句柄"

#: ../../src/fs_poll.rst:7
msgid ""
"FS Poll handles allow the user to monitor a given path for changes. "
"Unlike :c:type:`uv_fs_event_t`, fs poll handles use `stat` to detect when"
" a file has changed so they can work on file systems where fs event "
"handles can't."
msgstr "FS Poll 句柄允许用户监视给定路径的变化。与 :c:type:`uv_fs_event_t` 不同，FS Poll 句柄使用 `stat` 来检测文件何时发生变化，因此它们能够用在 FS Event 句柄无法工作的文件系统上。"

#: ../../src/fs_poll.rst:13
msgid "Data types"
msgstr "数据类型"

#: ../../src/fs_poll.rst:17
msgid "FS Poll handle type."
msgstr "FS Poll 句柄类型。"

#: ../../src/fs_poll.rst:21
msgid ""
"Callback passed to :c:func:`uv_fs_poll_start` which will be called "
"repeatedly after the handle is started, when any change happens to the "
"monitored path."
msgstr "传递给 :c:func:`uv_fs_poll_start` 的回调，在句柄启动之后，只要被监视的路径发生任何变化，它就会被反复调用。"

#: ../../src/fs_poll.rst:24
msgid ""
"The callback is invoked with `status < 0` if `path` does not exist or is "
"inaccessible. The watcher is *not* stopped but your callback is not "
"called again until something changes (e.g. when the file is created or "
"the error reason changes)."
msgstr "回调会以 `status < 0` 被调用，此时 `path` 不存在或不可访问。监视器 *不会* 停止，但在发生某种变化之前（例如文件被创建，或错误原因发生改变），回调不会再被调用。"

#: ../../src/fs_poll.rst:29
msgid ""
"When `status == 0`, the callback receives pointers to the old and new "
":c:type:`uv_stat_t` structs. They are valid for the duration of the "
"callback only."
msgstr "当 `status == 0` 时，回调会收到指向旧、新 :c:type:`uv_stat_t` 结构体的指针。它们仅在回调执行期间有效。"

#: ../../src/fs_poll.rst:35
msgid "Public members"
msgstr "公开成员"

#: ../../src/fs_poll.rst:37
msgid "N/A"
msgstr "无"

#: ../../src/fs_poll.rst:39
msgid "The :c:type:`uv_handle_t` members also apply."
msgstr ":c:type:`uv_handle_t` 的成员也同样适用。"

#: ../../src/fs_poll.rst:43
msgid "API"
msgstr "API"

#: ../../src/fs_poll.rst:47
msgid "Initialize the handle."
msgstr "初始化句柄。"

#: ../../src/fs_poll.rst:51
msgid "Check the file at `path` for changes every `interval` milliseconds."
msgstr "检查 `path` 处的文件是否有变化，间隔为 `interval` 毫秒。"

#: ../../src/fs_poll.rst:54
msgid ""
"For maximum portability, use multi-second intervals. Sub-second intervals"
" will not detect all changes on many file systems."
msgstr "为获得最大的可移植性，请使用多秒级的间隔。在许多文件系统上，亚秒级间隔无法检测到全部变化。"

#: ../../src/fs_poll.rst:59
msgid "Stop the handle, the callback will no longer be called."
msgstr "停止句柄，回调将不再被调用。"

#: ../../src/fs_poll.rst:63
msgid ""
"Get the path being monitored by the handle. The buffer must be "
"preallocated by the user. Returns 0 on success or an error code < 0 in "
"case of failure. On success, `buffer` will contain the path and `size` "
"its length. If the buffer is not big enough `UV_ENOBUFS` will be returned"
" and `size` will be set to the required size."
msgstr "获取该句柄正在监视的路径。缓冲区必须由用户预先分配。成功时返回 0，失败时返回小于 0 的错误码。成功时，`buffer` 将包含该路径，`size` 为其长度。如果缓冲区不够大，将返回 `UV_ENOBUFS`，并且 `size` 会被设置为所需的大小。"

#: ../../src/fs_poll.rst:69
msgid ""
"the returned length no longer includes the terminating null byte, and the"
" buffer is not null terminated."
msgstr "返回的长度不再包含结尾的空终止字节，且缓冲区不会以空字节结尾。"

#: ../../src/fs_poll.rst:72
msgid ""
"the returned length includes the terminating null byte on `UV_ENOBUFS`, "
"and the buffer is null terminated on success."
msgstr "在 `UV_ENOBUFS` 时返回的长度包含结尾的空终止字节，成功时缓冲区会以空字节结尾。"

#: ../../src/fs_poll.rst:77
msgid "The :c:type:`uv_handle_t` API functions also apply."
msgstr ":c:type:`uv_handle_t` 的 API 函数也同样适用。"

